<view class="page">
  <view class="page-head">
    <view class="page-eyebrow">离线工具 / 材料冲片计算</view>
    <view class="page-title">批量计算</view>
    <view class="page-desc">按模板填写数据，支持直接粘贴表格内容或从微信聊天选择 CSV 文件。单次最多 500 条，文件不超过 2 MB。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">第一步 · 准备数据</text>
      <text class="section-sub">CSV / 制表符</text>
    </view>

    <view class="note">
      <text class="note-title">表头必须依次为</text>
      材质,厚度(mm),宽度(mm),材料重量(kg),冲料方式,单重公式
      <view class="template-demo">示例：201,0.3,600,100,双排,2</view>
      单重公式填 1（圆片密度算法）或 2（圆片密度高级算法）；仅单排可填 3（方片密度算法）。旧版文件导入前需互换公式 1、2 的编号。
    </view>

    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCopyTemplate">复制模板表头</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onSaveTemplate">保存模板文件</button>
    </view>

    <view class="field template-field">
      <text class="field-label">粘贴数据 <text class="unit">首行为表头，可直接粘贴 Excel 单元格区域</text></text>
      <textarea
        class="textarea"
        value="{{text}}"
        placeholder="材质,厚度(mm),宽度(mm),材料重量(kg),冲料方式,单重公式&#10;201,0.3,600,100,双排,2"
        maxlength="-1"
        bindinput="onTextInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">或从微信聊天选择 CSV 文件 <text class="unit">可先发到「文件传输助手」</text></text>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-block btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onChooseFile">选择 CSV 文件</button>
      <view wx:if="{{fileName}}" class="file-chip">已选择：{{fileName}}（{{fileSizeText}}）</view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onRun">计算批量数据</button>
    <view wx:if="{{status}}" class="status {{statusError ? 'is-error' : ''}}">{{status}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{rows.length}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">逐行结果</text>
      <text class="section-sub">{{summary}}</text>
    </view>

    <scroll-view scroll-x class="batch-scroll">
      <view class="batch-table">
        <view class="table-head">
          <view class="cell cell-line">行</view>
          <view class="cell cell-mat">材质</view>
          <view class="cell">厚度</view>
          <view class="cell">宽度</view>
          <view class="cell">重量</view>
          <view class="cell cell-mode">冲料</view>
          <view class="cell cell-cut">剪口</view>
          <view class="cell cell-qty">数量</view>
          <view class="cell cell-scrap">角料(kg)</view>
          <view class="cell cell-state">状态</view>
        </view>
        <view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="line" class="table-row {{item.isError ? 'is-error' : ''}}">
          <view class="cell cell-line">{{item.line}}</view>
          <view class="cell cell-mat">{{item.material}}</view>
          <view class="cell">{{item.thickness}}</view>
          <view class="cell">{{item.width}}</view>
          <view class="cell">{{item.weight}}</view>
          <view class="cell cell-mode">{{item.modeText}}</view>
          <view class="cell cell-cut">{{item.cut}}</view>
          <view class="cell cell-qty">{{item.quantityText}}</view>
          <view class="cell cell-scrap">{{item.scrapText}}</view>
          <view class="cell cell-state">
            <text class="badge {{item.isError ? 'badge-error' : 'badge-ok'}}">{{item.stateText}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onExportCsv">导出有效行 CSV</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-small" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onCopyInvalid">复制错误行</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="note">
    <text class="note-title">小程序端说明</text>
    有效行会自动写入本机历史记录。小程序不解析 XLSX 二进制，若原始数据是 Excel，请在电脑上「另存为 CSV UTF-8」，再通过「文件传输助手」发送到微信后导入。
  </view>
</view>
